{"id":"n69297-1-10","stage":1,"title":"모자 · 帽子","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69297-1-10-1","ko":"유민아, 네가 쓴 모자는 어디서 샀어?","zh":"裕敏，你戴的那顶帽子是在哪儿买的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"쓴","meaning":"戴","explanation":"쓰다：戴；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65173","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓴","audio":"/audio/5c9c6af663ac529cd1c2.mp3"}},{"text":"모자는","meaning":"帽子","explanation":"모자：帽子；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"모자","audio":"/audio/4bf2a7500031422684ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69297","senseId":"1","lemma":"모자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모자는","audio":"/audio/1ba6b161a50f76741054.mp3"}},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"샀어?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceR