p3"}},{"text":"샀어.","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀어","audio":"/audio/99447433ba1c04adef5e.mp3"}},{"text":"생긴","meaning":"长","explanation":"생기다：长；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생긴","audio":"/audio/6a1f8f2f14401a79cbc7.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"독특해서","meaning":"独特，特别","explanation":"독특하다：独特，特别；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"독특하다","audio":"/audio/73e0cc965811b704e9eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14400","senseId":"1","lemma":"독특하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"독특해서","audio":"/audio/21476c9098c47bd5717a.mp3"}},{"text":"마음에","meaning":"心意，心思","explanation":"마음：心意，心思；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"4","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음에","audio":"/audio/43f69e9e8e24ba2d0d8c.mp3"}},{"text":"들더라고.","meaning":"中意，称心，看中","explanation":"들다：中意，称心，看中；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"11","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들더라고","audio":"/audio/42a00cdd14bbe8224cb1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"c140e1936b454b24","term":"옆","zh":"旁，旁边","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3","entryId":"20243","definition":"指左右两侧中的一侧。","pronunciation":["엽"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"73e0cc965811b704","term":"독특하다","zh":"独特，特别","audio":"/audio/73e0cc965811b704e9eb.mp3","entryId":"14400","definition":"与其它东西想比较而言，大不相同。","pronunciation":["독트카다"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心意，心思","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"喜爱或关心的心情。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"中意，称心，看中","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"觉得某物好。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6521dd6202d2bdc52160.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.832,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69297","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.2827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["裕敏，你戴的那顶帽子是在哪儿买的？","是在学校旁边的店里买的。因为它设计很独特，所以我特别喜欢。","和上个月相比，成绩下降了呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裕敏，你戴的那顶帽子是在哪